===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*spey-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|spoke}}, from {{inh|en|ang|spāca}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*spaikǭ}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A support structure that connects the [[axle]] or the [[hub]] of a [[wheel]] to the [[rim]].
# {{lb|en|nautical}} A projecting handle of a steering wheel.
# A [[rung]] of a [[ladder]].
# A [[stick]] inserted into the [[wheel]] of a [[vehicle]] to keep the wheel from turning.
# One of the [[outlying]] points in a [[hub-and-spoke]] model of [[transportation]].

